cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Neuro3D-Lab"
type: software
abstract: "Virtual optical laboratory: scalar-field propagation, Fresnel diffraction, interferometers and diffractive neural networks (optlab), a finite-support backend with Rayleigh-Sommerfeld references, convergence estimates and a pre-registered benchmark protocol (neuro3d_completion), and a Blender add-on front end. Simulation only."
version: 0.2.0-dev
date-released: 2026-10-13
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
